{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOMB発売中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香と飛鳥と私の3人が\nプリンシパルについて語ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルの稽古の日々。\n大変だが頑張ってます。\n楽しんでる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／\n描いたり作ったりなんかしらしたら\n載せてみるこーなー\n＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことに、\n家が色鉛筆に溢れてます。\n幸せだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は母の日。\n私のお母さんは\n自分を持っている人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔からお母さんの服を\nお下がりで着てたので、\n昔から渋好み。\n中学生のときの好きな色は\nカーキと紫でした。\n明るい色の服は着る勇気がなくて\n避けていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年を重ねるにつれて\nお母さんとの趣味が合うように\nなってきてるし、\n昔は嫌がっていたものも\n好きになってきてるし、\n影響されまくりだな〜\nと実感しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のお母さんがお母さん\nじゃなかったらどうなってたんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、自分でクラッチバッグを\n作ったそうです。\nそんなお母さんが好きです。\n師匠！リスペクト！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはメガネ買うとしたら\n何色が好き？\n▶︎べっ甲。\n今使ってるのもべっ甲！\nヴィンテージの細縁も好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言いたいことがあったら\nその時点で一番上に上がってる\nブログにコメントしちゃって\n良いのかな？？\n▶︎最近ブログ更新率\n下がってしまっていてごめんなさい。\nもちろん！コメント全部\nしっかり読んでます〜\n報告でもなんでも\nメールの返信でもしてちょうだい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな壁も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り越えるんだ！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/11/1076618/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おああああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっしゃああああああああああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}